  "original_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"primary-heading\" class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col h-full max-w-[1024px]\"><h1 id=\"primary-heading\" class=\"sr-only\">Home</h1><div><div class=\"max-w-[680px] m-auto px-1 flex flex-col gap-y-6\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">New Member Onboarding Guide</h1><div class=\"border-b border-slate-200\"></div><div id=\"pm-1\" class=\"border-0 flex flex-col gap-y-4 ProseMirror\" data-context=\"doc\" data-input-id=\"pm-doc-html-c3496e76-b853-4544-b7f4-4de8014be675\" data-editable=\"false\" data-progress=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\" translate=\"yes\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-welcome\">👋🏻👋🏼👋🏽👋🏾👋🏿 Welcome</h2><p>Welcome to Literacy That Works! We&#39;re excited to have you join our community of practice.</p><p>This guide will help you navigate everything we offer and get the most out of your experience here.</p><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-community-announcements\">📢 Community Announcements</h2><p>Check here regularly for important updates, upcoming events, and news that affects our community. We&#39;ll keep you in the loop on everything you need to know.</p><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/0e4e7a3073b943ed99694978e53cfb87?sid=7e01787f-98d5-45b4-bd12-f6ba3f93c492\" height=\"500\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://www.loom.com/embed/0e4e7a3073b943ed99694978e53cfb87?sid=7e01787f-98d5-45b4-bd12-f6ba3f93c492\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-join-a-discussion\">💬 Join a Discussion</h2><p>Ready to connect? Click the chat icon to jump into <b>discussions</b> with other members. Share your insights, ask questions, upload resources, and learn from each other&#39;s experiences.</p><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/c296c9896b5f464aa0848810895e5dee?sid=658d96b4-9905-4833-8af7-4dd5fcf0a2f3\" height=\"500\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://www.loom.com/embed/c296c9896b5f464aa0848810895e5dee?sid=658d96b4-9905-4833-8af7-4dd5fcf0a2f3\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-literacy-routines-space\">🌐 Literacy Routines Space</h2><p>This is your hub for all four course modules we&#39;re offering this fall. You&#39;ll find everything organized and ready to explore at your own pace. Join the <b>space</b> today!</p><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/b42f3bed9a12414fa818429e0269ec02?sid=87f1d8a2-a3ad-4a11-b025-e5144a2d2640\" height=\"500\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://www.loom.com/embed/b42f3bed9a12414fa818429e0269ec02?sid=87f1d8a2-a3ad-4a11-b025-e5144a2d2640\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-fall-2025-course-modules\">📚 Fall 2025 Course Modules</h2><p>We&#39;ve designed four <b>modules</b> for you this fall, each with distinct sections to guide your learning:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p><b>📊 Framing Our Work</b> We&#39;ll set the stage by exploring the context and background that shapes what we&#39;re learning together.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p><b>🤔 What to Expect</b> Get a clear picture of what you&#39;ll experience in each module—think of this as your roadmap.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p><b>💡 Try and Share</b> Here&#39;s where things get hands-on. You&#39;ll experiment with new strategies, connect with fellow members, and share what you&#39;re discovering along the way.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p><b>🏆 Earn Recognition</b> We celebrate your growth! Learn how you can earn recognition for the effort you&#39;re putting into your professional development.</p></li></ul><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/f7c0409610254defab9ca4b8102b2bbc?sid=d7724767-f9e8-4893-9a1d-2401bd0d3330\" height=\"500\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://www.loom.com/embed/f7c0409610254defab9ca4b8102b2bbc?sid=d7724767-f9e8-4893-9a1d-2401bd0d3330\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-badges-and-microcredentials\">🏅 Badges and Microcredentials</h2><p>As you progress through the modules, you&#39;ll earn digital credentials that showcase your learning. Here&#39;s how it works:</p><p>You&#39;ll automatically receive a <b>badge</b> after participating in discussions where you reflect on your learning and exchange ideas with colleagues and facilitators.</p><p>Submit coursework for your module and you can earn a <b>microcredential</b>. Your facilitator will review your work, give you personalized feedback, and award the microcredential when you&#39;ve met the criteria.</p><p>Once you&#39;ve completed all four fall modules and earned your badges and microcredentials, you&#39;ll receive the <b>Cultivating Literacy Routines credential</b>—marking your full completion of this semester&#39;s work.</p><div data-type=\"badge-embed\" data-badge-id=\"072b926b-40d4-4cca-b7e4-8f9459cc9aec\" data-badge-type=\"credential\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"https://participate.community/badge/072b926b-40d4-4cca-b7e4-8f9459cc9aec\" class=\"flex flex-col border border-slate-300\"><div class=\"font-bold bg-slate-300 h-6 w-full pl-4\">Credential</div><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\"><p class=\"font-bold line-clamp-1\">Cultivating Literacy Routines</p><p class=\"text-slate-600 line-clamp-2\">This credential recognizes your full participation in the Literacy th@t Works fall online course modules. By completing all modules, earning each badge and microcredential, and engaging in reflection and discussion, you have demonstrated a sustained commitment to building literacy routines and practicing teacher inquiry. This credential signifies your accomplishment in completing the fall semester coursework and your readiness to carry these practices forward into your classroom and future professional learning.</p><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">participate.community</p></div><img class=\"h-32 w-32 border-l border-slate-300 object-cover\" src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/e846af2-Credential%20Cultivating%20Literacy.png\"/></div></a></div><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/af7679fb5b8f496c818d35de9611c8c5?sid=af545b6d-d297-4c96-a5a1-b671c052e6df\" height=\"500\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://www.loom.com/embed/af7679fb5b8f496c818d35de9611c8c5?sid=af545b6d-d297-4c96-a5a1-b671c052e6df\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-member-profile-and-dashboard\">🪪 Member Profile and Dashboard</h2><p>Your profile and dashboard is where you&#39;ll manage your learning journey.</p><p>Display your earned badges on your <b>member profile</b> to showcase your expertise to the community. You can also add them to your LinkedIn profile to highlight your professional development and credentials with colleagues and employers.</p><p>Think of your <b>dashboard</b> as home base—everything you need is right here:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p><b>Recently viewed</b> – Quick access to content you&#39;ve been exploring</p></li><li class=